; Pasture3D Water — Ocean preset, high tier. Spec §6.
;
; The default for Pasture3D.ocean_material (constants.h OCEAN_MATERIAL_PATH).
;
; Note what is NOT here: the wave table. For the ocean the waves are generated in
; C++ and uploaded every time a knob changes, because the CPU height query has to
; read the identical table (§4.2, §4.3). Setting `_waves` here would be
; overwritten on the first update and would make the query disagree with the
; surface in the meantime. Shape the ocean's waves with the ocean_wave_* group on
; the Pasture3D node, not with this resource.
;
; The lake and pond presets DO ship a table, because nothing runs in C++ for a
; material dropped on a bare MeshInstance3D.
;
; NOTHING `_`-PREFIXED BELONGS IN HERE. Those uniforms are written by the plugin --
; _waves by the manager, _mesh_size / _subdiv / _vertex_spacing / _target_pos by the
; clipmap, _water_domain_origin per instance -- and Pasture3DPoolManager::
; is_plugin_written_param() skips every one of them when syncing a preset into the
; duplicate a body draws with. Storing them here is inert at best and misleading at
; worst.
;
; They were here once: opening this material in the inspector and saving it
; serialises whatever the plugin had just written into it, which is how an all-zero
; `_waves` and a stale _mesh_size of 32 got committed in 6967bdd, and how these
; comments got stripped (Godot's resource writer does not preserve them). If this
; header is missing and `_`-prefixed parameters are back, that is what happened --
; delete them and restore this block. M_water_ocean_low.tres is the untouched
; reference for what this file should look like.
[gd_resource type="ShaderMaterial" format=4 uid="uid://cu5tyca37mw4v"]

[ext_resource type="Shader" uid="uid://dwc65bc2s82vl" path="res://addons/pasture_3d/extras/shaders/water/water_ocean.gdshader" id="1_shader"]
[ext_resource type="Texture2D" uid="uid://dtowtl3jy30s8" path="res://addons/pasture_3d/extras/shaders/water/OceanDetail.png" id="2_vm77f"]
[ext_resource type="Texture2D" uid="uid://dps0nipf3at3t" path="res://addons/pasture_3d/extras/shaders/water/HeightOceanFoam.png" id="3_mewtu"]

